WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.730
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.340
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.300
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.990
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.370
Kana

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:22.710
Chiaki

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:50.040
Weather for
the Three Sisters

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.550
A Story from the Summer

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.420
I'm heading out.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.150
Take care!

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.600
Damn it. Why does Haruka get a day off from class?

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:08.060
This is the school's way of taking care of Haruka-neesama, who has always been busy.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.060
What? Is the school taking care of her?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.580
To be more specific, you can say that it's the country that's taking care of her.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:18.030
What? I see, if it is the country, then I have nothing more to say.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.600
All the clothes are washed.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:30.330
It's still early in the morning, and I have nothing to do.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.920
What should I do now?

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:53.060
<i>Right now, Haruka must be relaxing and drinking tea.</i>

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.530
I'm so envious.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.750
With this kind of weather, the clothes will dry very quickly.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.710
Everything that needed to be scrubbed is all done.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:24.000
There's nothing to do.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.860
<i>Right now, Haruka-neesama must be taking a good, relaxing rest.</i>

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.400
<i>Take a good rest.</i>

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.910
<i>From tomorrow, it'll be back to the normal busy days.</i>

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.780
<i>Please take a good break for today.</i>

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.790
I never knew that it was so boring being alone.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.910
If I had known, I would have gone out for a walk.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.210
Should I make some snacks?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:57.480
Damn it. At least have some delicious cake waiting for me when I get home.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.170
If not, I'll be very pissed!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.430
Keiko, you believe so too, right?

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.560
Right?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.020
Alright! Minami!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.560
I never thought that just by passing the time, I would do such a nice job.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:20.160
Come to think of it, I've yet to eat lunch.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:27.540
Please take a good rest. You do not have to be concerned about us.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.200
What's wrong, Minami?

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.670
Pick up that bucket of water and stand in the corner.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.050
Yes!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.550
It's delicious. It's delicious!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.670
And, it must be one with lots of cream.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.890
Otherwise, I'll be pissed.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.590
I'll be pissed!

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.070
Wait for it, my stomach!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.530
I'm back!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.240
Welcome back.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.420
Where's our share?

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.500
Huh? What?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.840
Why are you pretending to be ignorant?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:27.430
You have cream at the corner of your mouth!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.720
You secretly ate it right, the sweet cake!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.140
I was actually looking forward to the beauty of that strawberry cream cake!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:35.800
At this rate, Haruka-neesama's day of happiness will go down the gutter.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:36.630
I was actually looking forward to the beauty of that strawberry cream cake!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.520
<i>Looks like I will need to interfere.
I was actually looking forward to the beauty of that strawberry cream cake!</i>

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.210
You...

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.930
Calm down, Kana.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:45.410
What? How can you tell me to be calm under such circumstances?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.300
That...

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.530
is shaving foam.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:50.910
Hurry up and improvise.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:01.460
So-Sorry for mouthing off at you like that.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.590
I see. Beard huh...

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.300
You're of that age.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.060
Minami-ke.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.480
Wake up.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:32.120
Why must I be sat on by my younger sister early in the morning?

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.860
It's because you cannot wake up.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.910
Breakfast was ready.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.560
If you continued to sleep,

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.290
Your eyelashes would have tangled up, and you could never open your eyes again.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.090
Be thankful, idiot.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:49.610
Haruka-neesama, let me help with dinner tonight.

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:50.770
Really? Thank you.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.010
Then what should we do?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:57.240
<i>Damned Chiaki. Wait till you oversleep,</i>

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.640
<i>I will squish you tomorrow!</i>

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:01.480
Sure!

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.860
Hey Chiaki. Wake up.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.130
What?

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.600
So, what?

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.970
Let us talk into the night.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.590
Into the night... What do you want?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:54.220
You've always treated me like an idiot. But, what do you actually think of me?

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.300
Let's talk about this.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:00.640
I see. I've never talked much about this.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.340
I did not explain this well enough.

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:12.680
Actually, I wanted to use thousands of words to loudly describe what kind of an idiot you are.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:18.260
But sadly, my tongue cannot move that quickly.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:22.490
How should I express it? I also have other things which I want to speak about.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:26.740
So, all I can say is the word "idiot". That's the best I can do.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:33.700
But, with that, you will not know how exactly you're being an idiot.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.500
If I could,

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:41.910
I would want your idiotic actions to be written out page by page into a ten thousand page report.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:46.410
But, the sad thing is, I do not have time to do that.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.700
Please forgive your useless sister.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.300
Good night.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.680
Wait!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.730
Is there something else?

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.690
It's not "something else".

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.180
When I stayed silent and listened to you talk,

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.890
Your tongue moved very quickly.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.610
I want to hear more of your words.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:17.380
So, I'm not saying that your brain is useless.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.980
Yeah!

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:26.500
In order to please the people around you, you became an idiot.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.370
Yeah!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:35.250
I've always been thinking.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:40.220
The real idiots are always awake.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.290
Yeah. That's right.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:46.190
I've also been thinking.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:51.150
What did I do to endure such a punishment?

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:54.840
What's wrong? You look really tired.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.840
Yeah. You just realized?

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:02.220
In fact, I was tired 4 hours ago.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:07.080
I've spoken for such a long time. I'm thirsty.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:17.710
Hey, Chiaki. Between cola and orange juice, what do you want to drink?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:22.350
Give me some cola. If I do not get stimulated by some really stiff drink, I can't carry on.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.530
Remember to brush your teeth later.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.340
My teeth hurts.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.670
Cheers!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:37.400
Hurry up and let me sleep!

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.270
What's the time now?

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.660
Three o'clock, snack time. Both of you don't get any.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.230
Next Saturday

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.220
This is?

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:36.800
In regards to how stupid you are, I've compiled a ten thousand word report.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:41.030
Read all of it well, and make sure you reflect on it!

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.650
Kana has a fever and hasn't got out of bed yet.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:06.610
Did she catch a cold?

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:14.630
Welcome back....

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.700
I'm back.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.750
Are you ok?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.440
I'm fine.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.840
I just feel hot, that's all.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:30.040
Once I cover myself with a blanket, I feel really cold.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:34.070
I wonder what kind of day this is.

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:35.260
The weather...

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.570
Oh, here comes the bus.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:40.590
To: Underworld
Via the Minami house

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.520
Via the Minami house...
To: Underworld
Via the Minami house

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.780
"Under" and "World"... We're going to the Underworld?
To: Underworld
Via the Minami house

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:45.820
To: Underworld
Via the Minami house

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.470
I'm getting on!

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:50.990
Don't! That bus is dangerous.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.000
Consultation

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:59.130
I ate your cake a few days ago, anything that you want to say?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.620
It can't be helped.

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:04.190
<i>She didn't get angry, looks like it's really that serious.</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:09.050
I ate your cake just yesterday.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:12.270
You're actually hitting a patient...

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.270
Treatment

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.690
Chiaki.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:21.920
Isn't it amazing that idiots can catch colds too?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.930
It's because the idiot doesn't take care of herself which is why she got a cold.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.570
No matter what, I'm still an idiot...

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.770
Yes, yes, I'm an idiot.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:35.790
Idiot.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:41.750
You wait and see, I will get better soon.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.100
I will pull your face hard,

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.500
and make you say sorry.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:50.820
Await my revival.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.400
If you're agitated, your fever will rise.

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:07.320
Chiaki, thank you.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:11.980
It's fine, you don't have to look after me anymore.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:15.100
It's time for your favorite television show soon.

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:18.670
It's fine if I don't watch the television.

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:23.880
Seeing you suffer in pain...

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:28.010
is much more entertaining than watching television.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.250
Say sorry now!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.430
Like hell I would...

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.230
Say sorry!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.110
Never...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.480
I'm cured, thank you, Chiaki!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.700
It's cured!

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:52.390
Eh?

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:53.360
What's wrong?

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.260
Was I too rough with you?

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.460
Are you alright, Chiaki?

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:06.450
Think you can eat an apple?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.830
Here.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.090
I don't have any strength to swallow the whole apple...

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.850
Minami-ke.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.310
Thanks for the food.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.430
Chiaki, there's still leftovers.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:26.480
You can't do that, leaving capsicum and carrots which are good for your body.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.690
Please spare me from the coloured vegetables.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.470
Really, this kid is really picky about food.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.850
You won't grow at this rate.

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:40.410
So what does a mentally undeveloped person like you not eat?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.040
Stop it.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.530
Yes.

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.980
Oh, that's right.

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:56.370
Both of you, I'm going to do the laundry, so bring your clothes.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.390
Yes...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.970
Can I try that on?

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.680
Don't stay there watching, come and help me.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.300
Just a little more and it'll fit.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.500
I think it just tore.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.850
Take it off now!

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.440
No...

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.880
What are the both of you doing?

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:30.020
Chiaki, wear that and let me see.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.330
Haruka-neesama's uniform...

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:36.460
Then is it fine if I wear Kana's?

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.270
This brings back memories...

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.480
It's fine if you try it on,

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.130
but stop before it tears, okay?

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.950
Chiaki, do you know how to tie a necktie?

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.140
I don't know.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.520
Me too.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:56.860
Well, we will just put it on anyhow.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.550
Somehow, it looks totally different.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.550
Do it yourself then.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.460
It fits!

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.510
Kana, it's such a good thing that you're slim.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.800
Oh, is that so?

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.770
It almost couldn't fit in.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:25.480
Is that so? Just speak your mind.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.690
Kana is...

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.190
It's tight on the breasts, right? Just say so then.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.650
Suffocating serves you right.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:36.980
Haruka...

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.160
The bathroom cleaning is done.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:41.870
Look at that.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.420
Chiaki is fighting against the vegetables.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.620
Carrot, capsicum and chives.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.100
Fighting against three types at the same time?

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.260
Chiaki...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:05.960
Give it up!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.730
Cheer her on instead...!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.200
It's loose.

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:20.330
Just right.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.830
Damn it...

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.580
Minami-ke.

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.640
<i>I would like to eat cheese lemon custard chiffon pie...</i>

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.210
<i>Would Haruka make it for us?</i>

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:44.780
<i>We have been eating sweet stuff lately, I guess not then.</i>

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:50.490
<i>I want to eat it today, eat it now.</i>

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:54.250
<i>I guess she will make it if the preparations of ingredients are done.</i>

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:59.000
<i>No... even so, she might not make it immediately.</i>

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:03.990
<i>That's right!</i>

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:06.400
Hey, Chiaki.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:10.740
Haruka will be coming back late today, let's take this time to make some snacks.

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:11.650
Snacks?

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:14.420
Cheese lemon custard chiffon pie.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.840
Pie? Isn't that too hard for us?

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:21.680
Why don't we ask Haruka-neesama to make it when she gets back?

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.970
It's not that.

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.970
It's Haruka who wants to eat it.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:26.760
Eh?

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:30.100
We should do something as thanks to her for taking care of us, right?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.530
It's fine if it does not turn out well.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.460
That's right, it's the thought that counts.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.260
<i>Yeah, there's no need for Chiaki to do it well.</i>

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:47.790
<i>As long as Haruka sees Chiaki's feelings, she will make it again.</i>

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:52.370
You just now...

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.050
Said the only meaningful thing since your birth.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.050
It's not the first!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.280
I said it a couple of times.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:04.210
Anyway, Chiaki, let's do it.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.500
We're going to do it!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.990
It's done!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.470
It's done?

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.100
Please don't laze around.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:21.320
Taste testing...

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.690
There's no need to.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:23.950
It looks fine.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:27.350
I have to clear the kitchen now.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:33.620
<i>The one who wanted to eat was me...</i>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.960
I'm back.

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.530
Welcome back.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.690
A sweet smell?

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:46.770
I made cheese lemon custard chiffon pie which you wanted to eat.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:47.460
Eh?

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:48.840
Lemon..?

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:51.600
Did I say I wanted to eat it?

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.320
What is this?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.980
Cheese lemon custard chiffon pie.

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:05.320
It's not here.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.810
I cooperated with you, how can I not try it?

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.740
You did nothing at all!

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.830
It tasted good enough to give to Haruka.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.750
What are we going to give her now?!

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:20.520
We were supposed to give it to Haruka for all the care has she given us!

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.020
It's fine, it's fine.
We were supposed to give it to Haruka for all the care has she given us!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:24.640
I'm happy with just the thoughts from the both of you.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.620
But Haruka-Neesama...

